---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const copyright = year === 2026 ? '© 2026 Kabir Sekhon' : `© 2026-${year} Kabir Sekhon`;
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service — Upper Cafe">
  <style>
    h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: normal; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .subtitle { font-size: 0.82rem; color: #888; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; margin: 2rem 0 0.5rem; }
    p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #444; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    a { color: #8B6914; }
  </style>

  <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Last updated September 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; {copyright}</p>

  <p>Upper Cafe is a student attendance tool built for Bergen County Academies. By using this site or the web app at app.bcaupper.cafe, you agree to the following.</p>

  <h2>Use</h2>
  <p>This service is intended for BCA students and staff only. You agree to check in honestly — providing your real name, student ID, and the correct reason for your visit. Falsifying check-in records is a violation of BCA's academic integrity policy.</p>

  <h2>Data</h2>
  <p>We collect only the information you enter during check-in: your name, email, student ID, academy, grade, period, and whether your check-in was for a scheduled study hall or an absent teacher. This data is used solely to maintain an attendance roster for Upper Cafe monitors. We do not sell, share, or use it for any other purpose.</p>

  <h2>Availability</h2>
  <p>This is a school project. We do our best to keep it running during the school day, but we make no guarantees of uptime or data persistence. If the system is down, check in with the monitor manually.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms occasionally. Continued use after changes are posted means you accept the new terms.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:kabsek30@bergen.org">kabsek30@bergen.org</a>.</p>
</Layout>
